      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Scope and timing",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 4
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "Server-accepted saves only. Client-only captures and rejected attempts are unseen. API health does not prove save acceptance. Collector every 15m; values use a 45m lookback. Terminal failures cover 60m. Completion timing includes idle deferral and reprocessing. [Runbook](https://github.com/pffreitas/cosmic-dolphin/blob/main/docs/runbooks/save-bookmark-monitoring.md)."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Observer and API health",
        "description": "1 when the database snapshot succeeded, 0 when it failed.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 4,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 8
